text.paragraph:
Carisoprodol, the active ingredient in carisoprodol tablets, has been subject to abuse, dependence, and withdrawal, misuse and criminal diversion. [see Drug Abuse and Dependence (9.1, 9.2, 9.3)
                           ]. Abuse of carisoprodol tablets poses a risk of overdosage which may lead to death, CNS and respiratory depression, hypotension, seizures, and other disorders [see Overdosage (10)
                           ].
